# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Internet Frontend — DEVELOPMENT overrides
# Loaded automatically by Vite when running `vite` (dev mode).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Empty — Vite's dev server proxy handles /socket.io → localhost:3001.
# Do not set a URL here in dev; the proxy is more reliable than hardcoding.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=
